WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.204
ALEX: NVIDIA just announced
OpenShell — a full reference

00:00:03.204 --> 00:00:06.408
ALEX: architecture designed to
govern and contain autonomous AI

00:00:06.408 --> 00:00:09.611
ALEX: agents in production. Not a
chip. Not a

00:00:09.611 --> 00:00:12.815
ALEX: model. A governance stack,
with ten major security

00:00:12.815 --> 00:00:16.019
ALEX: partners already signed on.

00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:18.300
JAMIE: That's the thing nobody
predicted. The chip company

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.470
JAMIE: is now the safety company.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.538
RUFUS: And the safety company
immediately requires more of

00:00:22.538 --> 00:00:24.496
RUFUS: the chip company's chips.
